From 16c47ec989c79b6ccce7515d75f063f9e6b736b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 07:18:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(jax): render scatter steps in affineReference
 (ordered placement table)

A scatter node renders as the compute half's affine tables plus dest_shape and a static
dest_flat_index table in the dense worker's coordinate order. Adds checkJaxScatterSupport
(same compute-half policy, scatter checker re-run) and the JaxCodegenError.scatterPlacementOutOfRange
backstop. einsumOnly and the evidence candidate path still refuse scatter.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
